WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.668
-Good evening
and Happy Thanksgiving!

00:00:02.668 --> 00:00:04.103
I'm Seth Meyers
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:04.103 --> 00:00:06.906
We hope you're doing well
and now, let's get to the news.

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:09.075
Happy Thanksgiving, everybody.

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:11.143
Let me just say
I hope your Thanksgiving

00:00:11.143 --> 00:00:12.378
was just like mine --

00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:14.948
taped ahead of time,
so you can watch football.

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:16.816
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:19.151
Today was Thanksgiving, so,
if you're watching right now,

00:00:19.151 --> 00:00:22.489
I'm guessing sex on a trundle
bed didn't work out?

00:00:22.489 --> 00:00:26.025
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.025 --> 00:00:28.227
According to a new survey,
the average cost

00:00:28.227 --> 00:00:31.131
for a Thanksgiving meal
for 10 people this year is

00:00:31.131 --> 00:00:34.166
around $64, plus,
whatever you owe your cousin

00:00:34.166 --> 00:00:35.468
for hooking you up.

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:37.903
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.903 --> 00:00:40.773
The Supreme Court said this week
that the IRS can send

00:00:40.773 --> 00:00:43.042
former President Trump's
tax return to Congress,

00:00:43.042 --> 00:00:44.577
but, luckily, it's Thanksgiving,

00:00:44.577 --> 00:00:46.980
so, he's got one more trick
up his sleeve.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.248
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.248 --> 00:00:51.850
According to a new survey,
around half of Americans said

00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:53.052
that they would rather

00:00:53.052 --> 00:00:55.154
spend time with their family
on Thanksgiving

00:00:55.154 --> 00:00:57.490
than receive $1,000 cash,

00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:59.158
as opposed to my family,

00:00:59.158 --> 00:01:01.694
who I had to pay to hang out
with me tonight.

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:03.529
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:03.529 --> 00:01:05.965
Vogue released pictures this
week from President Biden's

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:07.633
granddaughter Naomi's
White House wedding,

00:01:07.633 --> 00:01:10.570
including photos
with First Lady Dr. Jill Biden.

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:12.438
They would've published
President Biden's photo,

00:01:12.438 --> 00:01:14.807
but they all featured
a big thumb in the corner.

00:01:14.807 --> 00:01:16.375
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.375 --> 00:01:17.844
[ As Biden ]
Uh, that's a good one!

00:01:17.844 --> 00:01:19.512
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:21.948
According to the latest numbers,
the price of ham

00:01:21.948 --> 00:01:24.550
has increased this year
by more than 9%,

00:01:24.550 --> 00:01:27.353
but, eventually, it's expected
to start spiraling.

00:01:27.353 --> 00:01:28.987
[ Laughter and groans ]

00:01:28.987 --> 00:01:31.490
Look, if things get tense
with your family this weekend,

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:33.026
just tell the spiraling joke.

00:01:33.026 --> 00:01:35.327
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.327 --> 00:01:38.331
And, finally,
according to a new survey,

00:01:38.331 --> 00:01:41.633
33% of Americans said that they
definitely would not participate

00:01:41.633 --> 00:01:44.103
in a turkey trot race
over the Thanksgiving holiday,

00:01:44.103 --> 00:01:45.271
unless, of course,

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:46.840
there's a line
for the downstairs bathroom.

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:48.274
"Make way!
Make way!"

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:49.275
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:51.443
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

00:01:51.443 --> 00:01:52.612
[ Cheering and applause ]

